+    /**
+     * Feature that determines whether the declared base type of a polymorphic value
+     * should be used as the "default implementation" (similar to setting
+     * {@code defaultImpl} in {@link com.fasterxml.jackson.annotation.JsonTypeInfo})
+     * when no type information is provided in the JSON.
